-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",307,{
[9793]="70068BFF\n1\tConfront the successful proprietor\tZadok has asked you to help him collect a debt from a respectable proprietor in the Gut.\n2\tCollect the treasure chest\tYou have bested the successful proprietor. You are free to collect his treasures.\n3\tTalk to Zadok\tYou have the money that was promised to Zadok. You should return it to him.\n",
[9794]="7006100D\n1\tTalk to Prisca Boffin inside 8 Honeymead Lane\tPrisca Boffin is inside 8 Honeymead Lane, and she has asked to speak with you. Uh oh.\n2\tTalk to Dinodas on Honeymead Lane and complete 'Boffins on the Loose'\030Talk to Camellia on Honeymead Lane and complete 'Hiding the Evidence'\tPrisca Boffin has asked you to work with Dinodas and Camellia to repair the damage that has been done to Angelica's house-warming party.\n3\tTalk to Prisca Boffin inside 8 Honeymead Lane\tPrisca Boffin is inside 8 Honeymead Lane, waiting to hear that you have repaired the damage done to Angelica's house-warming party.\n",
[9795]="7005F872\n1\tFind Skálo and the Dourhand prisoner at Grúmachath\tSkálo and the Dourhand prisoner can be found at Grúmachath in Câr Bronach. After capturing a Dourhand warrior, Mézto hopes to undermine the Iron Crown. You should find Skálo and the Dourhand prisoner at Grúmachath.\n2\tTalk to Skálo at Grúmachath\tSkálo can be found at Grúmachath. You have found Skálo and the Dourhand prisoner at Grúmachath. You should talk to Skálo.\n3\tTalk to Rethvárd at Grúmachath\tRethvárd can be found at Grúmachath. After finding little success questioning his prisoner, Skálo has invited you to speak to Rethvárd. You should talk to Rethvárd.\n4\tAid Rethvárd with 'Best-laid Plans: Skáilag'\030Aid Rethvárd with 'Best-laid Plans: Toll Oivas'\tRethvárd can be found at Grúmachath. In exchange for your aid in revealing the treachery of Angmar to the Dourhands, Rethvárd has offered you information about the Iron Crown. You should talk to Rethvárd and aid him with his tasks.\n5\tTalk to Rethvárd at Grúmachath\tRethvárd can be found at Grúmachath. You have aided Rethvárd and hindered the Iron Crown in their efforts to raise the Dead of Câr Bronach. You should return to Rethvárd at Grúmachath.\n6\tTalk to Skálo at Grúmachath\tSkálo can be found at Grúmachath. After returning from the tasks Rethvárd set for you, you have found Skálo wounded and Rethvárd is nowhere to be found. You should talk to Skálo.\n",
[9796]="70071CD4\n1\tFind the entrance to the caves of Jâr Obadal\tFind the entrance to the caves of Jâr Obadal. Jâr Obadal can be found south-west of Ingar-garâsh.\n2\tDefeat spiders in Jâr Obadal (total: 12)\030Rescue trapped Subuzûri in cocoons (total: 5)\tDefeat spiders and search for missing Subuzûri warriors in Jâr Obadal.\n3\tReturn to Numûru in Ingar-garâsh\tReturn to Numûru in Ingar-garâsh with news of your victory.\n",
[9797]="7002F843\n1\tPrisoners from Wakenflood can be found in the Easterling encampment of Olghakhósh on the banks of the Anduin. You should find and free as many prisoners as you can in Olghakhósh.\t\n2\tReturn to Sergeant Hubyrt of Wakenflood\tSergeant Hubyrt can be found in Wakenflood in the Wold. You should return to Sergeant Hubyrt along with the men you freed.\n",
[9798]="70046C34\n1\tThe Haradrim prisoners can be found at Aelin Veren, in North Ithilien. Maendal has asked you to question the Haradrim prisoners and learn the reason for their surrender.\t\n2\tTalk to Maendal\tMaendal can be found at Aelin Veren, in North Ithilien. You have spoken to the prisoners and while not all of them cooperated, you feel that some measure of understanding has been reached for the moment. You should speak to Maendal.\n",
[9799]="70049570\n1\tFree imprisoned Stout-axes from the dungeons of Barad-dûr (0/8)\t\n2\tImprisoned Stout-axes can be found throughout the dungeons of Barad-dûr. In your search for King Váskmun Greytooth, you have found other Stout-axes imprisoned in Barad-dûr. You should free them.\t\n3\tCompleted\tYou have freed all the Stout-axes from the dungeons of Barad-dûr.\n",
[9800]="70047BD8\n1\tTortured captives can be found throughout Ondoher's Folly in north-western Dagorlad. Mincham has asked you to aid in freeing the Enemy's captives while you assault the hill of Ondoher's Folly.\t\n2\tTalk to Mincham at Tham Durlan\tMincham can be found at Tham Durlan, to the south of Ondoher's Folly in Dagorlad. You have freed as many of the captives as you were able, and you should now return to Mincham at Tham Durlan.\n",
[9801]="7004117B\n1\tSearch for prisoners in Tarlang's Crown (total: 4)\tPrisoners from Blackroot Vale can likely be found near the northern end of Tarlang's Crown. Melril has asked you to search for prisoners in Tarlang's Crown after finding that more people have gone missing from Blackroot Vale.\n2\tTalk to Melril\tMelril can be found at the northern end of Tarlang's Crown in Blackroot Vale. You searched for prisoners in Tarlang's Crown, but only discovered the remains of people of Gondor scattered about their camps. You should speak to Melril.\n",
[9802]="700001EE\n1\tUse Book-shelves (total: 99)\030Use Book-shelves\tThis cave was once the library of the great Benton Oakes, and its main room is full of book-shelves. Dorset Oakes is waiting for you to find the book-shelf that contains \"On the Hardiness of Animals in the Wilderness\". This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tTalk to Dorset Oakes\tDorset Oakes is at the entrance of the cave. Dorset is waiting for you to return with the book he asked for.\n",
[9803]="7006C8A7\n1\tDefeat scather-flies (total: 6)\tYou have been asked to defeat scather-flies scattered throughout the orange groves of Burukíri in Ambarûl.\n2\tTalk to Meliri\tYou have defeated scather-flies scattered throughout the orange groves of Burukíri in Ambarûl. You should return to Meliri.\n",
[9804]="70007B91\n1\tDestroy egg sacs in Amon Ros (total: 10)\tThe spiders' eggs can be found among their nests in Amon Ros, west of Ost Guruth. After telling you of the loss of his wife and son to the spiders of Amon Ros, Tortwil asked you to return to the vale and destroy any egg sacs you might find.\n2\tTalk to Tortwil\tTortwil awaits your return in Ost Guruth, east of Amon Ros. You found the egg sacs in the shadows of Amon Ros and destroyed them as Tortwil requested. You should return to Ost Guruth with the news of your success.\n",
[9805]="70061B9B\n1\tInjured residents of Mossward can be found lying on the ground nearby. Meneldir gave you a supply of salves and bandages with which you can treat the wounds of injured residents of Mossward.\t\n2\tTalk to Meneldir by the body of Madthrug\tMeneldir is by the east gate of Mossward, by the body of Madthrug. Having treated the wounds of some of the residents of Mossward who were injured during the attack, you should return to Meneldir and see what he has learned.\n3\tRetrieve the small item Madthrug holds in his hand\tMadthrug, the leader of the Uruk raiding party, might hold some clue to his purpose for attacking Mossward.\n4\tRead the scrap of parchment you took from the body of Madthrug\tYou took a small scrap of parchment from the body of Madthrug. What secrets does it hold?\n5\tGive the scrap of parchment to Meneldir\tMeneldir waits for you to show him the scrap of parchment you recovered from the body of Madthrug.\n6\tInvestigate what has excited the children to the north-west, in Mossward\tA noisy crowd of children has gathered to the north-west in Mossward. What has gotten them so excited?\n7\tTalk to Tegwyn\tIt appears that Tegwyn absconded with the cruel blade once wielded by Madthrug. Tegwyn might hurt himself or someone else unless you are able to take the weapon from him.\n8\tFind the defeat circle located to the north of Mossward\tThe nearest defeat circle is located north of Mossward. You have (reluctantly) agreed to teach Tegwyn some basic adventuring lessons, and what better place to begin than the local defeat circle?\n9\tTalk to Tegwyn at the defeat circle outside Mossward\tTegwyn stands at the defeat circle outside Mossward.\n10\tEnter the blacksmith shop in Mossward and teach Tegwyn about its utility\tThe blacksmith shop is located in Mossward, and is an important location for adventurers who seek to purchase new gear or repair their old equipment.\n11\tTalk to Tegwyn inside the blacksmith shop in Mossward\tTegwyn is inside the blacksmith shop in Mossward.\n12\tFind the training dummy located outside the blacksmith shop in Mossward\tA training dummy located just outside the blacksmith shop in Mossward will satisfy Tegwyn's eagerness to engage in combat training.\n13\tTalk to Tegwyn at the training dummy in Mossward\tTegwyn stands by the training dummy located in Mossward, eager to learn more about adventuring and combat.\n",
[9806]="70061BAB\n1\tUse Wild Attack on the training dummy\tTegwyn is waiting for you to demonstrate your combat ability by using Wild Attack on the training dummy.\n2\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have demonstrated a basic Champion attack to Tegwyn. Will he relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n3\tUse Savage Strikes on the training dummy (quantity: see journal)\tTegwyn is waiting for you to demonstrate your combat ability by using Savage Strikes on the training dummy.\n4\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have demonstrated how to unleash a Champion's Fervour by using the skill Savage Strikes. Will Tegwyn relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n5\tUse Remorseless Strike, Sudden Defence, or Blade Storm on the training dummy\t\n6\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have fulfilled your end of the bargain. Will Tegwyn relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n7\tBring the Uruk blade to Meneldir by the east gate of Mossward\tMeneldir is by the east gate of Mossward. Now that you have recovered the Uruk blade, you should bring it to Meneldir.\n",
[9807]="7006254E\n1\tUse Dextrous Hook on the training dummy (quantity: see journal)\t\n2\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have demonstrated a Mettle-building attack to Tegwyn. Will he relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n3\tUse Overhand Smash on the training dummy (quantity: see journal)\tTegwyn is waiting for you to demonstrate your combat ability by using Overhand Smash on the training dummy.\n4\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have demonstrated a Mettle-spending attack on the training dummy. Will Tegwyn relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n5\tUse Shattering Fist or Come At Me on the training dummy (quantity: see journal)\tTegwyn is waiting for you to demonstrate Shattering Fist or Come At Me on the training dummy.\n6\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have fulfilled your end of the bargain. Will Tegwyn relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n7\tBring the Uruk blade to Meneldir by the east gate of Mossward\tMeneldir is by the east gate of Mossward. Now that you have recovered the Uruk blade, you should bring it to Meneldir.\n",
[9808]="70062591\n1\tUse Battle-shout on the training dummy\tTegwyn is waiting for you to demonstrate your combat ability by using Battle-shout on the training dummy.\n2\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have demonstrated the Captain's Battle-shout to Tegwyn. Will he relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n3\tUse Devastating Blow on the training dummy (quantity: see journal)\tTegwyn is waiting for you to demonstrate your combat ability by using Devastating Blow on the training dummy.\n4\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have demonstrated how to follow Battle-shout with a powerful attack such as Devastating Blow. Will Tegwyn relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n5\tUse Shadow's Lament, Valiant Strike, or Elendil's Roar on the training dummy\t\n6\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have fulfilled your end of the bargain. Will Tegwyn relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n7\tBring the Uruk blade to Meneldir by the east gate of Mossward\tMeneldir is by the east gate of Mossward. Now that you have recovered the Uruk blade, you should bring it to Meneldir.\n",
[9809]="70062592\n1\tUse Fiery Ridicule on the training dummy (total: 3)\tTegwyn is waiting for you to demonstrate your combat ability by using Fiery Ridicule on the training dummy.\n2\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have demonstrated the skill Fiery Ridicule for Tegwyn. Will he relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n3\tUse Shocking Words on the training dummy\tTegwyn is waiting for you to demonstrate Shocking Words on the training dummy.\n4\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have demonstrated how to consume Battle Attunement to use Shocking Words. Will Tegwyn relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n5\tUse Smouldering Wrath, Sustaining Bolt, or Writ of Health on the training dummy\t\n6\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have fulfilled your end of the bargain. Will Tegwyn relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n7\tBring the Uruk blade to Meneldir by the east gate of Mossward\tMeneldir is by the east gate of Mossward. Now that you have recovered the Uruk blade, you should bring it to Meneldir.\n",
[9810]="70062593\n1\tUse Sting on the training dummy (total: 3)\tTegwyn is waiting for you to demonstrate your combat ability by using Sting on the training dummy.\n2\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have demonstrated the Guardian's mainstay skill, Sting, to Tegwyn. Will he relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n3\tUse Guardian's Ward on the training dummy\tTegwyn is waiting for you to demonstrate Guardian's Ward on the training dummy.\n4\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have demonstrated the core Guardian defensive skill, Guardian's Ward. Will Tegwyn relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n5\tUse Force Opening, Litany of Defiance, or Overwhelm on the training dummy\t\n6\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have fulfilled your end of the bargain. Will Tegwyn relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n7\tBring the Uruk blade to Meneldir by the east gate of Mossward\tMeneldir is by the east gate of Mossward. Now that you have recovered the Uruk blade, you should bring it to Meneldir.\n",
[9811]="70062594\n1\tUse Quick Thrust or Quick Toss on the training dummy (total: 3)\tTegwyn is waiting for you to demonstrate your combat ability by using Quick Thrust or Quick Toss on the training dummy.\n2\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have demonstrated how to perform a Quick Thrust. Will Tegwyn relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n3\tUse Offensive Strike on the training dummy\tTegwyn is waiting for you to demonstrate your combat ability by using Offensive Strike on the training dummy.\n4\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have demonstrated the skill Offensive Strike. Will Tegwyn relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n5\tUse Hampering Javelin or Warning Shot on the training dummy\t\n6\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have fulfilled your end of the bargain. Will Tegwyn relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n7\tBring the Uruk blade to Meneldir by the east gate of Mossward\tMeneldir is by the east gate of Mossward. Now that you have recovered the Uruk blade, you should bring it to Meneldir.\n",
[9812]="70062595\n1\tUse Slam on the training dummy (quantity: see journal)\tTegwyn is waiting for you to demonstrate your combat ability by using Slam on the training dummy.\n2\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have demonstrated a Wrath-building attack to Tegwyn. Will he relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n3\tUse Thrash on the training dummy (total: 3)\tTegwyn is waiting for you to demonstrate your combat ability by using Thrash on the training dummy.\n4\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have demonstrated an advanced Wrath-building technique on the training dummy. Will Tegwyn relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n5\tUse Bash, Claw Swipe, or Encouraging Roar on the training dummy (quantity: see journal)\tTegwyn is waiting for you to use Bash, Claw Swipe, or Encouraging Roar on the training dummy.\n6\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have fulfilled your end of the bargain. Will Tegwyn relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n7\tBring the Uruk blade to Meneldir by the east gate of Mossward\tMeneldir is by the east gate of Mossward. Now that you have recovered the Uruk blade, you should bring it to Meneldir.\n",
[9813]="70062596\n1\tUse Minor Ballad on the training dummy (total: 3)\tTegwyn is waiting for you to demonstrate your combat ability by using Minor Ballad on the training dummy.\n2\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have demonstrated a Minor Ballad for Tegwyn. Will he relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n3\tUse Coda of Fury, Coda of Melody, or Coda of Resonance on the training dummy\tTegwyn is waiting for you to to use a Coda on the training dummy.\n4\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have demonstrated a Coda for Tegwyn. Will he relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n5\tUse Lesser Anthem I - Resonance or Lesser Anthem II - Dissonance on the training dummy\tTegwyn is waiting for you to to use Lesser Anthem I - Resonance or Lesser Anthem II - Dissonance on the training dummy.\n6\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have fulfilled your end of the bargain. Will Tegwyn relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n7\tBring the Uruk blade to Meneldir by the east gate of Mossward\tMeneldir is by the east gate of Mossward. Now that you have recovered the Uruk blade, you should bring it to Meneldir.\n",
[9814]="70062597\n1\tUse Staff Strike while fighting the training dummy\tTegwyn is waiting for you to demonstrate your combat ability by using Staff Strike on the training dummy.\n2\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have demonstrated how to strike enemies with the skill Staff Strike.. Will Tegwyn relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n3\tUse Burning Embers on the training dummy (quantity: see journal)\t\n4\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have demonstrated how to apply a Damage over Time effect by using Burning Embers on an enemy. Will Tegwyn relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n5\tUse Sign of the Wild: Rage, Lightning Strike, or Test of Will while fighting the Training Dummy NOTE: To use Sign of the Wild: Rage, you will need to first need to summon an animal companion.\t\n6\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have fulfilled your end of the bargain. Will Tegwyn relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n7\tBring the Uruk blade to Meneldir by the east gate of Mossward\tMeneldir is by the east gate of Mossward. Now that you have recovered the Uruk blade, you should bring it to Meneldir.\n",
[9815]="70062598\n1\tUse Subtle Stab on the training dummy (total: 3)\tTegwyn is waiting for you to demonstrate your combat ability by using Subtle Stab on the training dummy.\n2\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have demonstrated a basic burglar attack to Tegwyn. Will he relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n3\tWhile in Stealth, use Surprise Strike on the training dummy\t\n4\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have demonstrated how to attack from Stealth on the training dummy. Will Tegwyn relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n5\tUse Feint Attack, Hedge Your Bet, or Trick: Disable on the training dummy\t\n6\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have fulfilled your end of the bargain. Will Tegwyn relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n7\tBring the Uruk blade to Meneldir by the east gate of Mossward\tMeneldir is by the east gate of Mossward. Now that you have recovered the Uruk blade, you should bring it to Meneldir.\n",
[9816]="70062599\n1\tUse Quick Shot on the training dummy\tTegwyn is waiting for you to demonstrate the Quick Shot ability on the training dummy.\n2\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have demonstrated how to perform a Quick Shot. Will Tegwyn relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n3\tUse Penetrating Shot on the training dummy (quantity: see journal)\tTegwyn is waiting for you to demonstrate your combat ability by using Penetrating Shot on the training dummy.\n4\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have demonstrated how to perform a Penetrating Shot. Will Tegwyn relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n5\tUse Barrage, Long Shot, or Pinning Shot on the training dummy\tTegwyn is waiting for you to demonstrate Barrage, Long Shot, or Pinning Shot on the training dummy.\n6\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have fulfilled your end of the bargain. Will Tegwyn relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n7\tBring the Uruk blade to Meneldir by the east gate of Mossward\tMeneldir is by the east gate of Mossward. Now that you have recovered the Uruk blade, you should bring it to Meneldir.\n",
[9817]="7006346D\n1\tBring the Uruk blade to Meneldir by the east gate of Mossward\tMeneldir is by the east gate of Mossward. Now that you have recovered the Uruk blade, you should bring it to Meneldir.\n",
[9818]="70067346\n1\tUse Thrust on the training dummy (total: 3)\tTegwyn is waiting for you to demonstrate your combat ability by using Thrust on the training dummy.\n2\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have demonstrated a basic Mariner attack to Tegwyn. Will he relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n3\tUse En Garde on the training dummy\tTegwyn asked you to use En Garde on the training dummy.\n4\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have demonstrated how to use En Garde. Will Tegwyn relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n5\tPress the 'J' key to open the traits panel. Choose a 'specialization' for your class to gain new skills and abilities. Don't worry, you can always change your mind later! After you choose a specialization, use Dramatic Flourish, Feint, or Thrum of the Sea on the training dummy.\t\n6\tTalk to Tegwyn by the training dummy\tYou have fulfilled your end of the bargain. Will Tegwyn relinquish the Uruk's blade to you, as he agreed?\n7\tBring the Uruk blade to Meneldir by the east gate of Mossward\tMeneldir is by the east gate of Mossward. Now that you have recovered the Uruk blade, you should bring it to Meneldir.\n",
[9819]="70061BAC\n1\tCollect kingsfoil near Mossward (total: 4)\030Defeat beasts near Mossward (total: 6)\tKingsfoil can be found on the hills east of Mossward, as can beasts that might threaten the town. Meneldir tasked you with a number of things you can do to help provide for the needful folk of Mossward.\n2\tBring the kingsfoil to Meneldir by the east gate of Mossward\tMeneldir is by the east gate in Mossward, waiting for you to return with the kingsfoil he requested you gather.\n3\tFind the Stable-master of Mossward to the south-west\tThe stable-master of Mossward can be found to the south-west of Meneldir. Meneldir recommended that you speak to the stable-master of Mossward and ride one of the horses to the village of Clegur, in the Stoor-vales, to warn that folk of their potential danger.\n4\tHire one of the stable-master's horses and follow the travel route to Clegur, in the Stoor-vales\tThe stable-master of Mossward offers an affordable and efficient travel route to Clegur, in the Stoor-vales.\n5\tTalk to Briallen Wynbuch in the village of Clegur\tBriallen Wynbuch is in the village of Clegur. She should be told the reason for your arrival.\n",
[9820]="70061BC5\n1\tTalk to Malmadog Torlan outside his house to the south of the Clegur stable-master\tMalmadog Torlan, the mayor of Clegur, can be found outside his house to the south of the stable-master. You have been asked to inform the mayor of Clegur about the worrisome happenings beyond the Stoor-vales.\n2\tCollect choice cuts of meat from beasts in the Stoor-vales (total: 6)\tChoice cuts of meat from the beasts prowling the Stoor-vales can be used to feed the folk of Clegur as winter approaches.\n3\tBring choice cuts of meat to Cunedda Moltgig in his shop in Clegur\tCunedda Moltgig, the butcher of Clegur, can be found in his shop to the south-east of the pond in Clegur. You collected some choice cuts of meat and should bring them to the butcher in Clegur.\n4\tTalk to Meneldir outside the butcher shop in Clegur\tMeneldir has come to the village of Clegur, in the Stoor-vales.\n5\tFind a helpful villager in Glyn Helyg to tell you of recent events in the Stoor-vales\030Find a helpful villager in Lintrev to tell you of recent events in the Stoor-vales\tGlyn Helyg and Lintrev are both located north-east of Clegur, in the Stoor-vales. Meneldir asked you to check in with folk in the other Stoor villages to learn if the recent troubles have affected them in any way, or if the Uruks had eyes only for Mossward.\n6\tTalk to Malmadog Torlan in the village of Clegur\tMalmadog Torlan, the mayor of Clegur, is located outside his house on the southern slope of the village. You have checked in with the other villages of the Stoor-vales and should report now to the mayor of Clegur.\n7\tTalk to Flam Helur in the village of Clegur\tA hunter has returned to Clegur with most interesting tidings!\n",
[9821]="70061BC6\n1\tTalk to Meneldir and follow Flam back to the captive Uruk\tMeneldir is in the village of Clegur, in the Stoor-vales. The Ranger's opinion is obvious: he wants the two of you to follow the Stoor hunter back to the captive Uruk.\n2\tTalk to Malmadog Torlan in the village of Clegur\tMalmadog Torlan, the Mayor of Clegur, is pleased that you helped his folk.\n",
[9822]="70061BC8\n1\tTalk to Meneldir in the village of Clegur\tMeneldir stands by the mayor in the village of Clegur, in the Stoor-vales.\n2\tReturn to the town square of Mossward\tMeneldir desires to return to Mossward to speak with the townspeople there, and he recommended you do the same.\n3\tTalk to Cadogan in the Mossward town square\tCadogan addresses the crowd.\n4\tPick up a barrel of swords inside the Mossward blacksmith shop\tCadogan asked you to carry a barrel of swords from within Skardí Bendblade's shop to the town square so the folk of Mossward can be armed against further intrusion by the Uruks.\n5\tTalk to Meneldir north-west of the town square, in Mossward\tMeneldir is to the north-west, trying to get your attention.\n6\tHear what Meneldir knows of Saruman the Wizard\030Hear what Meneldir knows of Radagast the Wizard\030Hear what Meneldir knows of Gandalf the Wizard\tMeneldir wishes to discuss what he knows of the Wizards that walk in Middle-earth.\n7\tTalk to Meneldir north-west of the town square, in Mossward\tMeneldir is north-west of the town square, in Mossward.\n",
[9823]="70000161\n1\tDefeat Jagger Jack\030Poison wolf food-sources (quantity: see journal)\tJagger Jack and the animal corpses will be in the Blackwold ruins in the north Chetwood, north of the guard-house, east of Combe. Ellie told you to find Jagger Jack and poison the wolves' food source, while she tries to arrange a meeting with Skunkwood, the Blackwolds' leader, for you.\n2\tSpeak with Ellie Cutleaf in Combe\tEllie Cutleaf's house is in the north-west corner of Combe, on the banks of the pond. You should return to Ellie Cutleaf with word of your victory against Jagger Jack and to learn if she has arranged a meeting with Skunkwood at the Blackwold hideout.\n",
[9824]="7004B218\n1\tTalk to Taerthon in Celondim\t\n2\tTalk to Taerthon in Celondim\tTaerthon can be found near the docks in Celondim. You have travelled to Celondim, and the time soon approaches to sail to the Uttermost West.\n",
})
